#: aboutunit.rsareyousureyouwanttolaunchdbvm
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to launch DBVM? You seem to be running in 32-bit, so "
"don't really need it that badly (Except for ultimap and cloaked operations)"
msgstr "Estas seguro de que quieres iniciar DBVM? Parece que se esta ejecutando en 32 bits, asi que realmente no lo necesito tan mal (Excepto por ultimap y operaciones ocultas)"

#: aboutunit.rsdidyoureallythinkyoudfindaneastereggbydoingthiswel
msgid ""
"Did you really think you'd find an easter egg by doing this? Well, you know "
"what? You where right!"
msgstr "Realmente pensaste que encontrarias un huevo de Pascua haciendo esto? Bueno, sabes que? Estabas bien!"

#: aboutunit.rslaunchdbvmwasnotassigned
msgid "launchdbvm was not assigned"
msgstr "launchdbvm no fue asignado"

#: aboutunit.rsthismeansthatyourecurrentlynotrunningdbvm
msgid ""
"This means that you're currently not running dbvm, but that your system is "
"capable of running it"
msgstr "Esto significa que actualmente no esta ejecutando dbvm, pero que su sistema es capaz de ejecutarlo"

#: aboutunit.rsthismeansthatyoursystemisrunningdbvm
msgid ""
"This means that your system is running dbvm. This means ce will make use of "
"some advanced tools that are otherwise unavailable"
msgstr "Esto significa que su sistema esta ejecutando dbvm. Esto significa que CE hara uso de algunas herramientas avanzadas que de otro modo no estan disponibles."

#: aboutunit.rsthismeansthatyouwillneedanewcpuinteltobeabletouset
msgid ""
"This means that you will need a new cpu (intel) to be able to use the advanced "
"dbvm options"
msgstr "Esto significa que necesitara una nueva CPU (Intel) para poder utilizar las opciones de dbvm avanzadas"

#: aboutunit.rsyoursystemdoesnotsupportdbvm
msgid "Your system does not support DBVM. Perhaps it is already inside a VM"
msgstr "Tu sistema no admite DBVM. Puede que ya esté dentro de una máquina virtual"

#: aboutunit.rsyoursystemisrunningdbvmversion
msgid "Your system is running DBVM version %s (%.0n bytes free (%d pages))"
msgstr "Tu sistema ejecuta DBVM versión %s (%.0n bytes libres (%d páginas))"

#: aboutunit.rsyoursystemsupportsdbvm
msgid "Your system supports DBVM"
msgstr "Su sistema SI soporta DBVM."

